{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>All that.</b> All that you find to do of matters of pleasure, do, for there is no deed and reckoning of deed, or thought and knowledge and wisdom in Sheol, which is the grave. For Sheol is found for the righteous with Him, \"for I will go down to my son mourning to Sheol\" (Genesis 37:35)."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:28:39.096943881Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}